WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
The word "biodynamic" may be quickly misinterpreted.

2
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:09.990
The way I would like you to interpret it in relation to my course,

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.000
is that I explain ontogenetic developmental movement.

4
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:19.121
This is what I call biodynamics, the dynamics of life.

5
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.910
And how, somehow, it is organized by a creative genius,

6
00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:26.090
which can give rise to a kind of emergence of originality,

7
00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:27.669
like that, which appears.

8
00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:30.247
It's quite wonderful, ultimately.

9
00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:35.497
Now, you know, I think, a complement to the craniosacral system,

10
00:00:35.497 --> 00:00:39.657
which was perhaps simply anatomical at first, which now perhaps becomes

11
00:00:39.657 --> 00:00:41.597
embryological and dynamic.

